OL,6,FWhile the autumnal temperatures are
OL,7,Fsetting in, the skies over Cumbria and
OL,8,Fthe North East are still providing
OL,9,Famazing displays.
OL,11,FDramatic clouds, glorious sunsets and
OL,12,Fheavy skies were captured by the BBC
OL,13,FWeather Watchers across the region.
OL,15,FHere are some of our top picks.
